  "title": "Comment \"Money\" and I'll send you all the prompts 👇 What happens when you ask ChatGPT to make you",
  "description": "Comment \"Money\" and I'll send you all the prompts 👇 What happens when you ask ChatGPT to make you an extra $1,000 a week? I tried this 4 prompt chain and after a month it was actually working. Prompt 1: \"Based on everything you know about me, what is the fastest way to make an extra $1,000 a week? Limit it to one offer and one channel only.\" Prompt 2: \"Who is the most successful person I should be learning from to make this happen? Give me one name.\" Prompt 3: \"Pretend you are that person. Create me a 90-day action plan that needs less than $500 upfront and gets me my first paying customer as fast as possible.\" Prompt 4: \"Now act as my business coach. Ask me one question at a time until you find the one thing actually holding me back. Then reframe it and give me a two-week plan to prove this works.\" ChatGPT gives you the exact step by step blueprint to make an extra $1,000 a week. #chatgpt #ai #chatgptprompts #makemoney #entrepreneur",
